# Render and input

Views read `World` and draw. Mutation goes through `commands.ts` (or `tick` / `tickAi` in the ticker).

- Sim step is fixed `1/60` in `src/main.ts`. Do not tick the sim from a view.
- `update()` every frame; `retheme()` only when the scene palette changes.
- Keep Pixi in `render/` (and `main.ts`). Input may import view types for preview/camera only.
- Palette/scene colors live in `palette.ts`. Faction look comes from `floraPalette` / `factionCoreHue`.
- One plant: canopy wood and searching roots share the collar. Split at the crust only for z-order (inward 2, rocks 3, canopy 4, seedlings 5). Roots stay planted (no sway).
